===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Staryu|25}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Smack''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon Frontiers|Kirlia δ|33|Kirlia}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon Frontiers}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Staryu}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

